[PrintTextModified Text:——我眨眨眼，望向天花板。|#0201Adv03_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:刚才的梦让我一时间有些混乱，<br>但我很快就理解了现状。|#0201Adv03_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:370_1
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:——这是【回溯了】吗……|#0201Adv03_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那就得从头开始了。|#0201Adv03_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我向着熟悉的天花板，<br>如此喃喃自语道。|#0201Adv03_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我被安排睡在昏暗牢狱中的<br>双层床上铺。|#0201Adv03_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然后。|#0201Adv03_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText

; がばりと起き上がる音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_1 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@Wait WaitMode:0.5
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:370_2
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:咦，怎、怎么回事，这里是……？|#0201Adv03_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:下铺睡着的是<br>樱羽艾玛。|#0201Adv03_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:牢、牢房……！？为什么！？|#0201Adv03_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我说，这里究竟是什么地方！？|#0201Adv03_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:当艾玛抓住铁栅栏大喊时，<br>四周几乎同时响起了少女们夹杂着尖叫的声音。|#0201Adv03_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Id:Stills Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:370_1
@Wait WaitMode:1.2

[PrintTextModified Text:（吵死了）|#0201Adv03_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:喧闹声让我心烦意乱。<br>为了让自己冷静下来，我深深地吸了一口气。|#0201Adv03_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我早已知道，<br>和我同室的是艾玛。|#0201Adv03_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我早已知道，<br>我会和最不想见到的人再会。|#0201Adv03_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:已经是第二次了，我不会有丝毫动摇。|#0201Adv03_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（没事，我能作出正确行动）|#0201Adv03_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（——即使看到她那张脸，我也能保持冷静）|#0201Adv03_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
