@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_178 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:我坐起身，<br>轻盈地从床上一跃而下。|#0201Adv03_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，艾玛。|#0201Adv03_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我在她背后向她搭话。<br>艾玛吓得肩头一颤，转过身来。|#0201Adv03_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:——！！|#0201Adv03_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛惊愕地看着我。<br>我甚至还能对这样的她露出微笑。|#0201Adv03_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:没什么好惊讶的。<br>你我成为了室友。<br>仅此而已。|#0201Adv03_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:欸？欸……？|#0201Adv03_Ema005| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:本以为自己可以保持平静。<br>但心里还是不由得泛起了波澜。|#0201Adv03_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（为什么你又出现在我面前）|#0201Adv03_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:心中涌起焦躁，<br>难以忍受的窒息感使得我从艾玛身上移开视线。|#0201Adv03_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:啊，你看，快开始了。|#0201Adv03_Hiro009| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我不顾还在目瞪口呆的艾玛，<br>边说边指向房间里的显示屏幕。|#0201Adv03_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; モニター音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_3 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

