; ＠備考◆配信中

[PrintTextModified Text:啊……喂喂……看得见画面吗……？<br>毕竟机器有好些年头了，故障特别多……唉呀呀。|#0201Adv03_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:大家好，我是典狱长。|#0201Adv03_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我想给大家作详细说明，<br>请各位到会客厅来集合。|#0201Adv03_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我会给大家打开牢房的锁，<br>之后请大家跟着带路的看守。|#0201Adv03_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:想反抗也没问题……<br>只不过小命不保罢了……嗯……|#0201Adv03_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_3 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor SubId:Overlay
@ModifyTextPrinter Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Normal.Default MakeDefault:true HideOther:true
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1,ArmR3
