@ModifyBackgroundExtended Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:看着屏幕上播放的画面，<br>我思考着。|#0201Adv03_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不该存在于世上的怪物。<br>还有，最重要的是——与艾玛的再会。|#0201Adv03_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:上次，我在这个时候，<br>被摆在眼前的事实乱了阵脚。|#0201Adv03_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:但我必须恢复冷静。<br>我开始深呼吸，尽可能地平息心中的躁动。|#0201Adv03_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（虽说内心产生了动摇，<br>　但我那时确实不应该那么做）|#0201Adv03_Hiro010|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（为什么当时会<br>　冲动到那个地步……）|#0201Adv03_Hiro011|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我清晰记得自己到底有多么冲动鲁莽。<br>那根本就不像平时的我。|#0201Adv03_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（必须保持理智。<br>　——【那个】马上要来了）|#0201Adv03_Hiro012|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

