[PrintTextModified Text:噫……|#0201Adv03_Ema007| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（这座监牢的看守……<br>　就是上次杀死我的怪物）|#0201Adv03_Hiro013|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:希、希罗……|#0201Adv03_Ema008| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:脸色苍白的艾玛紧紧抓住了我的手臂。|#0201Adv03_Narrative023| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:涌上一股甩开她的冲动。<br>但我还是忍下来了，决定暂时按兵不动。|#0201Adv03_Narrative024| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我眯起眼睛，仔细观察着看守。<br>不出所料，那显然是某种非人的东西。|#0201Adv03_Narrative025| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……现在只能接受现实。<br>反抗那个怪物是错误的。|#0201Adv03_Narrative026| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Rotation:,,0 Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0.6 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:1_1 SubId:Middle
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_5 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:等到看守从我们身边经过后，<br>我才不动声色地挣脱了艾玛的手。|#0201Adv03_Narrative027| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ResetText
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.9 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:SolidColor.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.5

