; 牢の扉が開く音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_119 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 AppearanceAndTransition:2_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended DissolveTexturePath:VerticalBlindGradually TintColor:#000000 Duration:0.99 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent.Custom SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:0.9

[PrintTextModified Text:然后独自一人走向过道。|#0201Adv03_Narrative028| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:0.75 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:呀啊啊啊！怪物别碰我！好恶心！<br>好了，好了啦，我走就是！！|#0201Adv03_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我看到泽渡可可<br>正在逃避看守。|#0201Adv03_Narrative029| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:其他被囚禁的少女们<br>也陆续走出来，来到过道上。|#0201Adv03_Narrative030| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:所有人的名字，我都已经记在脑子里了。|#0201Adv03_Narrative031| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50,50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:等、等我一下，希罗！|#0201Adv03_Ema009| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:如预料中的一样，艾玛追了上来。<br>我转身，直视着艾玛的脸。|#0201Adv03_Narrative032| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Normal1

[PrintTextModified Text:居然在这种地方遇到你，<br>我真的吓了一跳……|#0201Adv03_Ema010| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一点也不惊讶。|#0201Adv03_Hiro014| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:虽然发生了很多事，<br>我们能不能还像以前那样做朋友……|#0201Adv03_Ema011| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:抱歉，我没有那个打算。<br>我无法原谅你，这一点不会改变。|#0201Adv03_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Cry1

[PrintTextModified Text:——|#0201Adv03_Ema012| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛这副很受伤的表情，令我更加火大。|#0201Adv03_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说完了？那我走了。|#0201Adv03_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:即使是第二次经历，<br>还是想把她推开。|#0201Adv03_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我转身快步走向过道——这时。|#0201Adv03_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1

; ＠備考◆言葉の途中で転倒

[PrintTextModified Text:我不会放弃的——啊、|#0201Adv03_Ema013| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 転ぶ音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_6 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:听到喊声我回头，<br>发现艾玛摔倒了。|#0201Adv03_Narrative036| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆痛がっている

[PrintTextModified Text:呜、啊……|#0201Adv03_Ema014| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她被坚硬的石地板擦伤了膝盖，<br>痛得皱起了脸。|#0201Adv03_Narrative037| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（这就是艾玛的本性）|#0201Adv03_Hiro017| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:上次我推她的时候，<br>她摔得很夸张，表现出的严重性比我的力道大多了。|#0201Adv03_Narrative038| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这次我甚至没有推她，<br>她还是试图用摔倒来引起我的注意。|#0201Adv03_Narrative039| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我不会再上当了）|#0201Adv03_Hiro018| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:把颤抖的手紧握成拳，<br>我无视艾玛继续往前走。|#0201Adv03_Narrative040| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:随着憎恨涌上心头，<br>我的胸口一阵阵发紧发痛。|#0201Adv03_Narrative041| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……再也不想见到她了）|#0201Adv03_Hiro019| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我抬头看着从地下层通往一楼的楼梯。|#0201Adv03_Narrative042| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（接下来，我会被看守杀死）|#0201Adv03_Hiro020| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我拥有一种神奇的力量。|#0201Adv03_Narrative043| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:按照在这座监牢中听到的说法，<br>或许可以称之为【魔法】。|#0201Adv03_Narrative044| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——我的【魔法】是【死亡回溯】。|#0201Adv03_Narrative045| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:只要死亡，<br>就会回到死亡当天早上醒来的时刻。|#0201Adv03_Narrative046| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:意识到自己拥有这种魔法，<br>是在小时候溺水死亡的时候。|#0201Adv03_Narrative047| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:经历了好几次同样的死亡，<br>才终于发现自己拥有这种魔法。|#0201Adv03_Narrative048| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:后来我还理解到，这是其他人做不到的事。<br>从那时起，我开始对这种魔法感到厌恶。|#0201Adv03_Narrative049| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:因为这是不正确的。|#0201Adv03_Narrative050| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不过，被看守砍下头颅而死属于意料之外，<br>既然已经回溯了，那也没办法。|#0201Adv03_Narrative051| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（首先得避免因失控而被看守杀死）|#0201Adv03_Hiro021| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我一边在心中坚定立誓，一边登上楼梯。|#0201Adv03_Narrative052| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

